# Personal, per-machine material at any depth (plans, memory, notes) never enters the repo.
**/local/

# Build output.
/bin/
/dist/

# criteria-review task plans: per-branch working state, like the plan files under .claude/local.
/.criteria/plan-*.json

# macOS Finder window settings: per machine, never part of the repository.
.DS_Store

# The binary a plain `go build ./cmd/engineroom` leaves in the root; scripts/install.sh builds elsewhere.
/engineroom

# The website built by tools/site; generated from docs/ and site/, never committed.
/site/out/

# The website dev server .engineroom/up builds and starts: its binary, its log and its process record.
/site/.serve/

# The slot record engineroom writes into a checkout that holds a slot (.engineroom/engineroom.toml).
.engineroom-slot.json
.engineroom-slot.env
